Here’s a comprehensive list of the major Crusades:

## The Numbered Crusades

**First Crusade (1096–1099)**
Parties: Western European knights (Franks, Normans, others) called by Pope Urban II vs. Seljuk Turks and Fatimid Caliphate
Places: Constantinople, Anatolia, Antioch, Jerusalem
Outcome: Crusader victory; establishment of Crusader states (Kingdom of Jerusalem, County of Edessa, Principality of Antioch, County of Tripoli)

**Second Crusade (1147–1149)**
Parties: France (Louis VII), Holy Roman Empire (Conrad III) vs. Seljuk Turks, Zengid dynasty
Places: Anatolia, Damascus, Edessa
Outcome: Crusader failure; Damascus siege abandoned

**Third Crusade (1189–1192)**
Parties: England (Richard I), France (Philip II), Holy Roman Empire (Frederick Barbarossa) vs. Ayyubid Sultanate (Saladin)
Places: Acre, Arsuf, Jaffa, failed approach to Jerusalem
Outcome: Stalemate; coastal cities recovered but Jerusalem remained Muslim

**Fourth Crusade (1202–1204)**
Parties: Western European Crusaders, Venice vs. Byzantine Empire (diverted from original target)
Places: Zara (Dalmatia), Constantinople
Outcome: Sack of Constantinople; Latin Empire established

**Fifth Crusade (1217–1221)**
Parties: Hungary (Andrew II), Austria, Holy Roman Empire, Papal forces vs. Ayyubid Egypt
Places: Acre, Damietta (Egypt)
Outcome: Crusader failure after initial gains in Egypt

**Sixth Crusade (1228–1229)**
Parties: Holy Roman Empire (Frederick II) vs. Ayyubid Sultanate (al-Kamil)
Places: Jerusalem, Bethlehem, Nazareth
Outcome: Diplomatic success; Jerusalem recovered through negotiation (held until 1244)

**Seventh Crusade (1248–1254)**
Parties: France (Louis IX) vs. Ayyubid Egypt, then Mamluks
Places: Cyprus, Damietta, Mansura (Egypt)
Outcome: Disaster; Louis captured and ransomed

**Eighth Crusade (1270)**
Parties: France (Louis IX), England (future Edward I) vs. Hafsid Tunis
Places: Tunis
Outcome: Failure; Louis IX died of disease

**Ninth Crusade (1271–1272)**
Parties: England (Edward I) vs. Mamluks (Baibars)
Places: Acre, Nazareth
Outcome: Minor truce; last major crusade to the Holy Land

